  "notes": "Scope taxonomy for RunMode=Discovery (docs/biostack/discovery-runbook.md). Each area drives open-ended queries against ClinicalTrials.gov v2, PubMed E-utilities and bioRxiv/medRxiv; openFDA new NDA/BLA originals are scanned regardless of area. Edit freely: adding an area widens what the worker can find without a code change. excludeKeywords drop trials and papers whose title or conditions are outside BioStack's scope (oncology and infectious disease).",
